  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will ensure nature-positive development and reduce ecosystem degradation in Samoa by valuing nature and applying Nature-based Solutions (NbS) with specific application to food and tourism sectors. This will be achieved through implementation of five project components that include (1) integration of nature values via Nature Capital Accounting (NCA) in key economic sectors through targeted economic, governance and financial interventions; (2) implementation landscape and seas</narrative>
  </description>
